{{PageBanner|Nameko banner 1.jpg|event}}

A collaboration event between [[The Battle Cats]] and the harvesting game known as '''Neo Mushroom Garden''' (おさわり探偵 なめこ栽培キット O Sawari Tantei Nameko Saibai Kitto) was held from July 28th, 2016 to August 11th, 2016. The collaboration includes includes daily stamps and exclusive stages going on during collab period. The game is published by [http://beeworksgames.com/ Beeworksgames].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Touch Detective: NEO Mushroom Garden'''}} and The Battle Cats Collaborate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between July 28th (4:00pm~) and August 11th (~3:59pm)'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Collab Stages available in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
A tide of Funghi are sprouting around the land of The Battle Cats! Will you help the Cats harvest these pesky invaders?<br>
Characters from Touch Detective: NEO Mushroom Garden will be appearing in The Battle Cats as limited ed. special enemies!<br>
Select Stories of Legend/Event Stages from the Title Menu of The Battle Cats app to locate the A Fungal Challenge collaboration map!<br>
<small>※If the collaboration stages do not appear, please update The Battle Cats to the most recent version and reboot the app.</small>

Clearing all stages on this map will give you a one-time reward of {{Color|#FF0000|'''30 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
Clearing any stage on the map will give you a small chance to collect the special unit [[Funghi (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Funghi'''}}]], only available from this event! Later stages in the map will have a greater chance of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Funghi'''}} appearing as a drop reward!<br>
※Using a Treasure Radar will allow you to capture the limited unit in one try from any stage in the A Fungal Challenge map.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Login each day during this event to collect Login Stamps and collect cool Cat Units and items!'''}}<br>
Logging into The Battle Cats each day during this event will grant you a special Login Stamp.<br>
Get more Login Stamps to collect rewards and special units like [[Tanky (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Tanky'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|''','''}} [[White Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''White Cat'''}}]] and [[Fortressy (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Fortessy'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|'''!'''}} Don't forget to keep coming back each day to make sure you get all the rewards!

For more information on Touch Detective: Neo Mushroom Garden, visit the URL below!<br>
http://www.namepara.com/neo/en/news/detail/160728_en.html

